1	//! Rate-limit and credits display shaping for status surfaces.
2	//!
3	//! This module maps `RateLimitSnapshot` protocol payloads into display-oriented rows that the TUI
4	//! can render in `/status` and status-line contexts without duplicating formatting logic.
5	//!
6	//! The key contract is that time-sensitive values are interpreted relative to a caller-provided
7	//! capture timestamp so stale detection and reset labels remain coherent for a given draw cycle.
